# The build context is this producer's own directory, and only its control
# template is COPYed out of it. The shared copyright file lives one level up and
# arrives through the `family` named context producer.env declares, so an edit
# to the driver, the README or a sibling producer cannot invalidate this
# producer's context.
#
# The anchors themselves are not here and are not a context. They are GENERATED
# by the first stage of the Dockerfile, from the pinned Debian base, which is
# what keeps this repository from carrying 150 certificates it did not issue.
*
!control/*.control
